{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0luZGlhbl9CYW5nbGEvMjAyMC0tQmVmb3JlL0J5b21rZXNoJTIwQmFrc2hpJTIwS29oZW4lMjBLb2JpJTIwS2FsaWRhcyUyMCUyODIwMTUlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Byomkesh Bakshi Kohen Kobi Kalidas","description":"The curtain rises on a small coalfield town. Plagued with a series of unexplained troubles that broke out suddenly, owner of a coalmine seeks the help of Byomkesh Bakshi to sort things out for him. When Byomkesh arrives with his trusted confidante Ajit, they discover to their complete dismay a maze of crimes woven around a violent murder that had little to do with the job that they were entrusted with. A mesmerizing mosaic of criminal characters, a sordid saga of lecherous lust, the thriller unfolds the complex layers of the human mind.\n\nRated U · Released 16 Oct 2015 · India · Language: Bengali · 110 min\nStudio: RP Techvision (I) Pvt. Ltd., Anjan Dutt Production\n\nOn your server — Audio: Bengali","releaseInfo":"2015","genres":["Thriller","Action","Crime","Bengali"],"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/1OmAhDaKVUwX0ueUXR63xXfBNLj.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lGAdlzjEWuHNXfP2p4CMuNgmMTq.jpg","imdbRating":"7.4","imdb_id":"tt5735210","moviedb_id":400267,"tmdbId":400267,"runtime":"110 min","cast":["Jisshu Sengupta","Saswata Chatterjee","Kaushik Sen","Shantilal Mukherjee","Chandan Sen","Ankitaa Chakraborty","Prantik Banerjee","Joyjit Banerjee"],"director":["Anjan Dutt"],"writer":["Anjan Dutt","Sharadindu Bandyopadhyay"],"released":"2015-10-16T00:00:00.000Z","country":"India","language":"Bengali","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Anjan Dutt","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lgCiLJXy1GfKpWRoRu6q4B6SAuy.jpg"},{"name":"Jisshu Sengupta","character":"Byomkesh","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6Ha4p2iQOHpnKC1uB4NKJ53kHRi.jpg"},{"name":"Saswata Chatterjee","character":"Ajit","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cVJVLDy7BNzIbFMcJBPOWeN0Kb.jpg"},{"name":"Kaushik